    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties present this 3 bedroom mid-terrace property to the market for sale. \n\nThis three-bedroom mid-terrace property is ideally located in the popular Highfield Estate in Newbridge and offers an excellent opportunity for homeowners, first-time buyers or investors alike.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, kitchen/dining room and a spacious living room on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms and a family-sized bathroom.\n\nThe property benefits from a large concrete rear yard, providing a practical outdoor space with excellent potential for low-maintenance use.\n\nWhile the property requires some modernisation and cosmetic renovation, it offers a great opportunity for the discerning purchaser to add their own style and value. With well-proportioned accommodation and a convenient location, this property is well worth viewing.\n\nAn ideal opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom home in a well-established residential area of Newbridge, with scope to modernise and create a comfortable home to suit individual requirements.\n\nViewing is highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Carpet flooring, understairs storage\n\nKitchen/Dining: Lino flooring, fully fitted kitchen units, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, cooker, washing machine, fridge freezer, stove fireplace, back door leading to rear garden\n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, feature fireplace with wrought iron insert and polished hearth\n\nBedroom 1: Wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring, fully fitted storage press/shelving\n\nBedroom 3: Lino flooring\n\nFamily Bathroom: Lino flooring, tiled surround, bath with shower, WHB, WC\n\nFeatures:\n\nPVC front door\nAttic access via landing\nPVC double glazed windows\nBlock built shed to rear\nMains water\nMains sewage\nNatural gas heating system\nBuilt in 1980\nc.76.82sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies."
